{"id":"vol9-04","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-04/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":456.27,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.96,"text":"IELTS Listening, version 50032.","words":[["IELTS",0.0,0.64],["Listening,",0.64,1.02],["version",1.68,2.16],["50032.",2.16,3.96]]},{"start":5.36,"end":11.46,"text":"You will hear a number of different recordings, and you will have to answer questions on what you hear.","words":[["You",5.36,6.0],["will",6.0,6.2],["hear",6.2,6.4],["a",6.4,6.6],["number",6.6,6.94],["of",6.94,7.18],["different",7.18,7.5],["recordings,",7.5,8.1],["and",8.74,8.94],["you",8.94,9.1],["will",9.1,9.22],["have",9.22,9.4],["to",9.4,9.54],["answer",9.54,9.82],["questions",9.82,10.38],["on",10.38,10.74],["what",10.74,10.92],["you",10.92,11.12],["hear.",11.12,11.46]]},{"start":12.3,"end":18.56,"text":"There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions, and you will have a chance to check your work.","words":[["There",12.3,12.68],["will",12.68,12.8],["be",12.8,12.96],["time",12.96,13.28],["for",13.28,13.52],["you",13.52,13.64],["to",13.64,13.74],["read",13.74,14.04],["the",14.04,14.32],["instructions",14.32,14.9],["and",14.9,15.22],["questions,",15.22,15.62],["and",16.18,16.56],["you",16.56,16.72],["will",16.72,16.86],["have",16.86,17.04],["a",17.04,17.16],["chance",17.16,17.44],["to",17.44,17.66],["check",17.66,17.98],["your",17.98,18.2],["work.",18.2,18.56]]},{"start":19.76,"end":22.8,"text":"All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["All",19.76,20.06],["the",20.06,20.2],["recordings",20.2,20.64],["will",20.64,21.04],["be",21.04,21.18],["played",21.18,21.58],["once",21.58,22.1],["only.",22.1,22.8]]},{"start":24.18,"end":26.96,"text":"The test is in four parts.","words":[["The",24.18,24.6],["test",24.6,25.04],["is",25.04,25.76],["in",25.76,25.9],["four",25.9,26.3],["parts.",26.3,26.96]]},{"start":26.96,"end":31.16,"text":"Write all your answers in the listening question booklet.","words":[["Write",26.96,28.1],["all",28.1,28.4],["your",28.4,28.58],["answers",28.58,29.0],["in",29.0,29.64],["the",29.64,29.76],["listening",29.76,30.12],["question",30.12,30.66],["booklet.",30.66,31.16]]},{"start":31.78,"end":38.0,"text":"At the end of the test, you will be given 10 minutes to transfer your answers to an answer sheet.","words":[["At",31.78,32.44],["the",32.44,32.58],["end",32.58,32.78],["of",32.78,32.9],["the",32.9,32.98],["test,",32.98,33.34],["you",33.8,34.04],["will",34.04,34.16],["be",34.16,34.3],["given",34.3,34.6],["10",34.6,35.02],["minutes",35.02,35.36],["to",35.36,35.72],["transfer",35.72,36.26],["your",36.26,36.5],["answers",36.5,36.9],["to",36.9,37.18],["an",37.18,37.36],["answer",37.36,37.64],["sheet.",37.64,38.0]]},{"start":40.18,"end":43.84,"text":"Now turn to part 1 on page 2 of your question booklet.","words":[["Now",40.18,40.42],["turn",40.42,40.64],["to",40.64,40.86],["part",40.86,41.06],["1",41.06,41.44],["on",41.44,41.9],["page",41.9,42.26],["2",42.26,42.7],["of",42.7,42.9],["your",42.9,43.0],["question",43.0,43.34],["booklet.",43.34,43.84]]},{"start":49.05,"end":49.71,"text":"Part 1","words":[["Part",49.05,49.25],["1",49.25,49.71]]},{"start":49.71,"end":54.49,"text":"You will hear a man phoning to book a place on a weekend course.","words":[["You",49.71,50.91],["will",50.91,51.09],["hear",51.09,51.29],["a",51.29,51.43],["man",51.43,51.79],["phoning",51.79,52.21],["to",52.21,52.49],["book",52.49,52.65],["a",52.65,52.81],["place",52.81,53.13],["on",53.13,53.47],["a",53.47,53.59],["weekend",53.59,53.87],["course.",53.87,54.49]]},{"start":55.41,"end":59.15,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 1-6.","words":[["First",55.41,56.07],["you",56.07,56.31],["have",56.31,56.47],["some",56.47,56.65],["time",56.65,57.03],["to",57.03,57.33],["look",57.33,57.47],["at",57.47,57.61],["questions",57.61,58.01],["1",58.01,58.57],["-6.",58.57,59.15]]},{"start":59.15,"end":92.57,"text":"Listen carefully and answer questions one to six.","words":[["Listen",59.15,60.19],["carefully",89.89,90.43],["and",90.43,90.77],["answer",90.77,91.09],["questions",91.09,91.69],["one",91.69,92.05],["to",92.05,92.23],["six.",92.23,92.57]]},{"start":95.91,"end":98.07,"text":"Hello Stanley House courses.","words":[["Hello",95.91,96.55],["Stanley",96.55,97.11],["House",97.11,97.63],["courses.",97.63,98.07]]},{"start":98.83,"end":103.33,"text":"Oh, hello. I'm ringing to book a place on one of your weekend courses.","words":[["Oh,",98.83,99.07],["hello.",99.07,99.39],["I'm",99.93,100.31],["ringing",100.31,100.51],["to",100.51,100.81],["book",100.81,100.99],["a",100.99,101.15],["place",101.15,101.41],["on",101.41,101.81],["one",101.81,102.05],["of",102.05,102.19],["your",102.19,102.33],["weekend",102.33,102.73],["courses.",102.73,103.33]]},{"start":103.91,"end":107.05,"text":"Very good. Which course are you interested in?","words":[["Very",103.91,104.15],["good.",104.15,104.41],["Which",105.03,105.51],["course",105.51,105.91],["are",105.91,106.23],["you",106.23,106.35],["interested",106.35,106.79],["in?",106.79,107.05]]},{"start":107.53,"end":111.53,"text":"Well, a guitar one. I think it was a workshop, actually.","words":[["Well,",107.53,107.83],["a",108.03,108.15],["guitar",108.15,108.43],["one.",108.43,108.89],["I",109.29,109.49],["think",109.49,109.87],["it",109.87,110.05],["was",110.05,110.15],["a",110.15,110.31],["workshop,",110.31,110.75],["actually.",111.13,111.53]]},{"start":111.83,"end":115.01,"text":"That's right. And when did you want to come?","words":[["That's",111.83,112.09],["right.",112.09,112.29],["And",112.87,113.41],["when",113.41,113.87],["did",113.87,114.13],["you",114.13,114.29],["want",114.29,114.47],["to",114.47,114.67],["come?",114.67,115.01]]},{"start":115.57,"end":120.87,"text":"Well, I was thinking of the weekend of July the 16th, if there's room then.","words":[["Well,",115.57,115.99],["I",116.09,116.31],["was",116.31,116.53],["thinking",116.53,116.97],["of",116.97,117.25],["the",117.25,117.39],["weekend",117.39,117.75],["of",117.75,118.11],["July",118.11,118.49],["the",118.49,118.79],["16th,",118.79,119.83],["if",119.89,120.01],["there's",120.01,120.29],["room",120.29,120.57],["then.",120.57,120.87]]},{"start":120.87,"end":122.73,"text":"Let me just check.","words":[["Let",120.87,121.51],["me",121.51,121.79],["just",121.79,122.17],["check.",122.17,122.73]]},{"start":124.01,"end":125.87,"text":"Oh, the 16th is a Wednesday.","words":[["Oh,",124.01,124.57],["the",124.65,124.69],["16th",124.69,125.23],["is",125.23,125.35],["a",125.35,125.49],["Wednesday.",125.49,125.87]]},{"start":126.59,"end":127.97,"text":"Did you mean the 18th?","words":[["Did",126.59,126.83],["you",126.83,126.95],["mean",126.95,127.11],["the",127.11,127.29],["18th?",127.29,127.97]]},{"start":128.43,"end":132.13,"text":"Oh, sorry. Yes, I was looking at the wrong month.","words":[["Oh,",128.43,128.87],["sorry.",129.09,129.49],["Yes,",129.87,130.23],["I",130.51,130.71],["was",130.71,130.89],["looking",130.89,131.15],["at",131.15,131.35],["the",131.35,131.43],["wrong",131.43,131.67],["month.",131.67,132.13]]},{"start":132.49,"end":133.35,"text":"No problem.","words":[["No",132.49,133.01],["problem.",133.01,133.35]]},{"start":134.07,"end":139.09,"text":"Yes, you're in luck. There are three places left there, so I'll put you down for one.","words":[["Yes,",134.07,134.49],["you're",134.73,134.95],["in",134.95,135.07],["luck.",135.07,135.33],["There",135.63,135.75],["are",135.75,135.87],["three",135.87,136.17],["places",136.17,136.69],["left",136.69,137.01],["there,",137.01,137.37],["so",137.53,137.81],["I'll",137.81,138.01],["put",138.01,138.21],["you",138.21,138.43],["down",138.43,138.67],["for",138.67,138.87],["one.",138.87,139.09]]},{"start":139.63,"end":143.73,"text":"So the code for that is Q1632.","words":[["So",139.63,139.89],["the",139.89,140.05],["code",140.05,140.39],["for",140.39,140.65],["that",140.65,140.87],["is",140.87,141.43],["Q1632.",141.43,143.73]]},{"start":144.37,"end":144.85,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",144.37,144.85]]},{"start":145.27,"end":146.73,"text":"That's just for our reference.","words":[["That's",145.27,145.71],["just",145.71,145.95],["for",145.95,146.21],["our",146.21,146.37],["reference.",146.37,146.73]]},{"start":147.27,"end":152.59,"text":"So, now for a few details. Can I just check if you've done any of our weekend courses","words":[["So,",147.27,147.77],["now",147.93,148.15],["for",148.15,148.33],["a",148.33,148.45],["few",148.45,148.65],["details.",148.65,149.17],["Can",149.71,149.85],["I",149.85,149.95],["just",149.95,150.19],["check",150.19,150.57],["if",150.57,150.75],["you've",150.75,151.01],["done",151.01,151.15],["any",151.15,151.45],["of",151.45,151.61],["our",151.61,151.77],["weekend",151.77,152.09],["courses",152.09,152.59]]},{"start":152.59,"end":153.01,"text":"before?","words":[["before?",152.59,153.01]]},{"start":153.55,"end":160.69,"text":"Yes, in fact I have. I did one last September. It was on photographs. We learnt about editing","words":[["Yes,",153.55,153.91],["in",154.19,154.43],["fact",154.43,154.67],["I",154.67,154.89],["have.",154.89,155.25],["I",155.57,155.73],["did",155.73,155.93],["one",155.93,156.15],["last",156.15,156.45],["September.",156.45,156.97],["It",157.61,157.75],["was",157.75,157.85],["on",157.85,158.03],["photographs.",158.03,158.57],["We",159.19,159.47],["learnt",159.47,159.91],["about",159.91,160.21],["editing",160.21,160.69]]},{"start":160.69,"end":162.17,"text":"them. I really enjoyed it.","words":[["them.",160.69,160.99],["I",161.23,161.37],["really",161.37,161.65],["enjoyed",161.65,161.95],["it.",161.95,162.17]]},{"start":162.41,"end":164.09,"text":"Yes, that's always a popular course.","words":[["Yes,",162.41,162.73],["that's",162.85,163.05],["always",163.05,163.27],["a",163.27,163.41],["popular",163.41,163.67],["course.",163.67,164.09]]},{"start":164.83,"end":170.83,"text":"So your details will be on the computer already. Let me see. I can just have your name,","words":[["So",164.83,165.05],["your",165.05,165.23],["details",165.23,165.69],["will",165.69,166.07],["be",166.07,166.21],["on",166.21,166.35],["the",166.35,166.51],["computer",166.51,167.09],["already.",167.09,167.63],["Let",168.07,168.17],["me",168.17,168.27],["see.",168.27,168.59],["I",169.39,169.63],["can",169.63,169.79],["just",169.79,170.07],["have",170.07,170.33],["your",170.33,170.47],["name,",170.47,170.83]]},{"start":170.93,"end":171.13,"text":"please.","words":[["please.",170.93,171.13]]},{"start":171.13,"end":178.03,"text":"It's Nick Posgit. That's P-O-S-K-I-T-T.","words":[["It's",171.13,172.15],["Nick",172.15,172.55],["Posgit.",172.55,173.43],["That's",173.71,174.19],["P",174.19,174.59],["-O",174.59,175.07],["-S",175.07,175.63],["-K",175.63,176.21],["-I",176.21,176.91],["-T",176.91,177.37],["-T.",177.37,178.03]]},{"start":178.47,"end":183.31,"text":"Oh, that's an unusual name, isn't it? Right, here we are.","words":[["Oh,",178.47,178.77],["that's",179.13,179.57],["an",179.57,179.69],["unusual",179.69,180.09],["name,",180.09,180.53],["isn't",180.61,180.79],["it?",180.79,181.01],["Right,",181.77,182.35],["here",182.75,182.99],["we",182.99,183.11],["are.",183.11,183.31]]},{"start":183.87,"end":187.75,"text":"So, is your address still 27 Hawthorne Road?","words":[["So,",183.87,184.19],["is",184.39,184.61],["your",184.61,184.81],["address",184.81,185.17],["still",185.17,185.61],["27",185.61,186.41],["Hawthorne",186.41,187.43],["Road?",187.43,187.75]]},{"start":188.25,"end":190.73,"text":"Oh, it's Hawthorne Way, actually.","words":[["Oh,",188.25,188.55],["it's",188.71,189.03],["Hawthorne",189.03,189.69],["Way,",189.69,190.01],["actually.",190.19,190.73]]},{"start":191.11,"end":198.61,"text":"OK, I'll correct that now. And it's Bristol BS4-2QG.","words":[["OK,",191.11,191.43],["I'll",191.77,192.07],["correct",192.07,192.33],["that",192.33,192.61],["now.",192.61,192.99],["And",193.71,194.23],["it's",194.23,194.69],["Bristol",194.69,195.27],["BS4",195.27,196.91],["-2QG.",196.91,198.61]]},{"start":198.97,"end":199.67,"text":"That's right.","words":[["That's",198.97,199.51],["right.",199.51,199.67]]},{"start":199.67,"end":205.21,"text":"Lovely. And the next thing I need from you is a contact phone number.","words":[["Lovely.",199.67,200.45],["And",201.19,201.75],["the",201.75,201.99],["next",201.99,202.33],["thing",202.33,202.63],["I",202.63,202.79],["need",202.79,202.99],["from",202.99,203.19],["you",203.19,203.45],["is",203.45,203.93],["a",203.93,204.05],["contact",204.05,204.39],["phone",204.39,204.81],["number.",204.81,205.21]]},{"start":205.67,"end":214.75,"text":"Okay, that's 077707 438297.","words":[["Okay,",205.67,206.15],["that's",206.47,207.07],["077707",207.07,210.51],["438297.",210.51,214.75]]},{"start":215.29,"end":219.73,"text":"Thanks. That's just in case we need to get hold of you in an emergency.","words":[["Thanks.",215.29,215.85],["That's",216.47,216.99],["just",216.99,217.15],["in",217.15,217.35],["case",217.35,217.57],["we",217.57,217.81],["need",217.81,217.97],["to",217.97,218.15],["get",218.15,218.27],["hold",218.27,218.55],["of",218.55,218.75],["you",218.75,218.93],["in",218.93,219.17],["an",219.17,219.27],["emergency.",219.27,219.73]]},{"start":220.79,"end":225.91,"text":"Now, if you've stayed with us before, you'll know that our guests all stay in shared accommodation.","words":[["Now,",220.79,221.09],["if",221.13,221.31],["you've",221.31,221.49],["stayed",221.49,221.69],["with",221.69,221.85],["us",221.85,221.97],["before,",221.97,222.39],["you'll",222.51,222.69],["know",222.69,222.91],["that",222.91,223.11],["our",223.11,223.31],["guests",223.31,223.71],["all",223.71,224.23],["stay",224.23,224.59],["in",224.59,224.79],["shared",224.79,225.15],["accommodation.",225.15,225.91]]},{"start":225.91,"end":232.21,"text":"And we've had quite a lot of requests lately for people to be put in with someone of a similar age.","words":[["And",225.91,226.73],["we've",226.73,226.97],["had",226.97,227.17],["quite",227.17,227.51],["a",227.51,227.73],["lot",227.73,227.89],["of",227.89,228.05],["requests",228.05,228.45],["lately",228.45,229.09],["for",229.09,229.39],["people",229.39,229.67],["to",229.67,229.91],["be",229.91,230.07],["put",230.07,230.35],["in",230.35,230.53],["with",230.53,230.69],["someone",230.69,230.97],["of",230.97,231.19],["a",231.19,231.29],["similar",231.29,231.57],["age.",231.57,232.21]]},{"start":232.79,"end":234.85,"text":"So can I ask how old you are?","words":[["So",232.79,233.19],["can",233.19,233.43],["I",233.43,233.59],["ask",233.59,233.89],["how",233.89,234.27],["old",234.27,234.53],["you",234.53,234.69],["are?",234.69,234.85]]},{"start":235.25,"end":236.71,"text":"Sure, I'm 26.","words":[["Sure,",235.25,235.59],["I'm",235.83,236.01],["26.",236.01,236.71]]},{"start":238.01,"end":240.23,"text":"And can I ask your occupation?","words":[["And",238.01,238.53],["can",238.53,238.81],["I",238.81,239.07],["ask",239.07,239.45],["your",239.45,239.67],["occupation?",239.67,240.23]]},{"start":241.15,"end":245.41,"text":"Engineer. I wish I could say musician, but maybe one day.","words":[["Engineer.",241.15,241.71],["I",242.35,242.55],["wish",242.55,242.75],["I",242.75,242.93],["could",242.93,243.03],["say",243.03,243.31],["musician,",243.31,243.83],["but",244.11,244.37],["maybe",244.37,244.81],["one",244.81,245.11],["day.",245.11,245.41]]},{"start":245.79,"end":246.75,"text":"Let's hope so.","words":[["Let's",245.79,246.29],["hope",246.29,246.49],["so.",246.49,246.75]]},{"start":250.09,"end":256.23,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 7 to 10.","words":[["Before",250.09,250.65],["you",250.65,250.93],["hear",250.93,251.21],["the",251.21,251.41],["rest",251.41,251.67],["of",251.67,251.79],["the",251.79,251.89],["conversation,",251.89,252.53],["you",253.15,253.35],["have",253.35,253.57],["some",253.57,253.75],["time",253.75,254.17],["to",254.17,254.47],["look",254.47,254.59],["at",254.59,254.75],["questions",254.75,255.07],["7",255.07,255.71],["to",255.71,255.95],["10.",255.95,256.23]]},{"start":256.23,"end":279.73,"text":"Now listen and answer questions seven to ten.","words":[["Now",256.23,257.27],["listen",276.95,277.31],["and",277.31,277.71],["answer",277.71,278.13],["questions",278.13,278.51],["seven",278.51,279.13],["to",279.13,279.33],["ten.",279.33,279.73]]},{"start":283.09,"end":288.73,"text":"Okay, so now about meals. Do you have any special dietary requirements?","words":[["Okay,",283.09,283.61],["so",283.73,283.95],["now",283.95,284.27],["about",284.27,284.81],["meals.",284.81,285.31],["Do",285.99,286.31],["you",286.31,286.47],["have",286.47,286.65],["any",286.65,286.91],["special",286.91,287.45],["dietary",287.45,288.01],["requirements?",288.01,288.73]]},{"start":289.71,"end":294.57,"text":"Well, I don't like any sort of fish. I'm fine with everything else.","words":[["Well,",289.71,290.17],["I",290.29,290.71],["don't",290.71,291.05],["like",291.05,291.27],["any",291.27,291.53],["sort",291.53,291.87],["of",291.87,292.03],["fish.",292.03,292.31],["I'm",292.89,293.35],["fine",293.35,293.67],["with",293.67,293.93],["everything",293.93,294.25],["else.",294.25,294.57]]},{"start":295.03,"end":297.21,"text":"That's fine. I'll make a note of that.","words":[["That's",295.03,295.35],["fine.",295.35,295.73],["I'll",296.13,296.31],["make",296.31,296.49],["a",296.49,296.63],["note",296.63,296.85],["of",296.85,296.99],["that.",296.99,297.21]]},{"start":298.13,"end":302.57,"text":"Okay, and if I could ask you just one more question about the course, Nick?","words":[["Okay,",298.13,298.77],["and",298.89,299.09],["if",299.09,299.31],["I",299.31,299.45],["could",299.45,299.63],["ask",299.63,300.05],["you",300.05,300.25],["just",300.25,300.51],["one",300.51,300.85],["more",300.85,301.11],["question",301.11,301.53],["about",301.53,301.77],["the",301.77,302.01],["course,",302.01,302.23],["Nick?",302.43,302.57]]},{"start":303.09,"end":303.43,"text":"Sure.","words":[["Sure.",303.09,303.43]]},{"start":303.43,"end":310